A commodity without a format warns but remains available in listings.

========== API ==========

commodities({ usage: 'all' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
commodity FUND

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "commodity": "FUND",
    "comment": null,
    "format": null,
    "isDefault": false,
    "used": false
  },
  {
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "comment": null,
    "format": "1,000.00 SEK",
    "isDefault": true,
    "used": false
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_COMMODITY_FORMAT] Commodity FUND must declare a format property
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:4:1
